WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.260
Your Inbox holds the questions agents are waiting on you to answer.

00:00:04.551 --> 00:00:06.351
This one is the Planner's.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:09.624
Pick an option, and give your reason in a note.

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:11.636
Unclear?

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.765
Ask back.

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:15.585
Answer, and it leaves your Inbox.

00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:18.562
CORE-8's spec keeps your answer.

00:00:18.842 --> 00:00:19.847
Open it from here.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.130
The decision block keeps the option you picked,

00:00:25.622 --> 00:00:26.344
your reason,

00:00:26.638 --> 00:00:27.403
and who answered.
